CREATE TABLE "MarketplacePublisher" ("id" TEXT PRIMARY KEY,"workspaceId" TEXT UNIQUE,"displayName" TEXT NOT NULL,"slug" TEXT UNIQUE NOT NULL,"description" TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT '',"website" TEXT,"status" TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'pending',"isOfficial" BOOLEAN NOT NULL DEFAULT false,"createdAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,"updatedAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CONSTRAINT "MarketplacePublisher_workspaceId_fkey" FOREIGN KEY ("workspaceId") REFERENCES "Workspace"("id") ON DELETE CASCADE);
CREATE TABLE "MarketplaceListing" ("id" TEXT PRIMARY KEY,"publisherId" TEXT NOT NULL,"slug" TEXT UNIQUE NOT NULL,"name" TEXT NOT NULL,"summary" TEXT NOT NULL,"description" TEXT NOT NULL,"category" TEXT NOT NULL,"packageType" TEXT NOT NULL,"status" TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'draft',"pricingModel" TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'free',"requestedScopes" TEXT[] NOT NULL DEFAULT ARRAY[]::TEXT[],"manifest" JSONB NOT NULL,"icon" TEXT,"installCount" INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,"reviewNotes" TEXT,"submittedAt" TIMESTAMP(3),"publishedAt" TIMESTAMP(3),"createdAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,"updatedAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CONSTRAINT "MarketplaceListing_publisherId_fkey" FOREIGN KEY ("publisherId") REFERENCES "MarketplacePublisher"("id") ON DELETE CASCADE);
CREATE TABLE "MarketplaceVersion" ("id" TEXT PRIMARY KEY,"listingId" TEXT NOT NULL,"version" TEXT NOT NULL,"manifest" JSONB NOT NULL,"changelog" TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT '',"status" TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'draft',"createdAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CONSTRAINT "MarketplaceVersion_listingId_fkey" FOREIGN KEY ("listingId") REFERENCES "MarketplaceListing"("id") ON DELETE CASCADE,UNIQUE("listingId","version"));
CREATE TABLE "MarketplaceInstall" ("id" TEXT PRIMARY KEY,"workspaceId" TEXT NOT NULL,"listingId" TEXT NOT NULL,"versionId" TEXT NOT NULL,"installedByMemberId" TEXT NOT NULL,"installedAgentId" TEXT,"status" TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'active',"config" JSONB,"installedAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,"updatedAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,"uninstalledAt" TIMESTAMP(3),CONSTRAINT "MarketplaceInstall_workspaceId_fkey" FOREIGN KEY ("workspaceId") REFERENCES "Workspace"("id") ON DELETE CASCADE,CONSTRAINT "MarketplaceInstall_listingId_fkey" FOREIGN KEY ("listingId") REFERENCES "MarketplaceListing"("id") ON DELETE CASCADE,CONSTRAINT "MarketplaceInstall_versionId_fkey" FOREIGN KEY ("versionId") REFERENCES "MarketplaceVersion"("id") ON DELETE RESTRICT,CONSTRAINT "MarketplaceInstall_installedByMemberId_fkey" FOREIGN KEY ("installedByMemberId") REFERENCES "WorkspaceMember"("id") ON DELETE CASCADE,UNIQUE("workspaceId","listingId"));
CREATE TABLE "MarketplaceModeration" ("id" TEXT PRIMARY KEY,"listingId" TEXT NOT NULL,"reviewerUserId" TEXT NOT NULL,"decision" TEXT NOT NULL,"notes" TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT '',"createdAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CONSTRAINT "MarketplaceModeration_listingId_fkey" FOREIGN KEY ("listingId") REFERENCES "MarketplaceListing"("id") ON DELETE CASCADE);
CREATE TABLE "PartnerAccount" ("id" TEXT PRIMARY KEY,"workspaceId" TEXT UNIQUE NOT NULL,"referralCode" TEXT UNIQUE NOT NULL,"status" TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'pending',"channel" TEXT,"website" TEXT,"createdAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,"updatedAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CONSTRAINT "PartnerAccount_workspaceId_fkey" FOREIGN KEY ("workspaceId") REFERENCES "Workspace"("id") ON DELETE CASCADE);
CREATE TABLE "PartnerAttribution" ("id" TEXT PRIMARY KEY,"partnerId" TEXT NOT NULL,"attributedWorkspaceId" TEXT UNIQUE NOT NULL,"source" TEXT,"landingPage" TEXT,"status" TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'signup',"createdAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CONSTRAINT "PartnerAttribution_partnerId_fkey" FOREIGN KEY ("partnerId") REFERENCES "PartnerAccount"("id") ON DELETE CASCADE,CONSTRAINT "PartnerAttribution_attributedWorkspaceId_fkey" FOREIGN KEY ("attributedWorkspaceId") REFERENCES "Workspace"("id") ON DELETE CASCADE);
CREATE INDEX "MarketplacePublisher_status_createdAt_idx" ON "MarketplacePublisher"("status","createdAt"); CREATE INDEX "MarketplaceListing_status_category_publishedAt_idx" ON "MarketplaceListing"("status","category","publishedAt"); CREATE INDEX "MarketplaceListing_publisherId_status_idx" ON "MarketplaceListing"("publisherId","status"); CREATE INDEX "MarketplaceVersion_listingId_status_createdAt_idx" ON "MarketplaceVersion"("listingId","status","createdAt"); CREATE INDEX "MarketplaceInstall_workspaceId_status_idx" ON "MarketplaceInstall"("workspaceId","status"); CREATE INDEX "MarketplaceInstall_listingId_status_idx" ON "MarketplaceInstall"("listingId","status"); CREATE INDEX "MarketplaceModeration_listingId_createdAt_idx" ON "MarketplaceModeration"("listingId","createdAt"); CREATE INDEX "MarketplaceModeration_reviewerUserId_createdAt_idx" ON "MarketplaceModeration"("reviewerUserId","createdAt"); CREATE INDEX "PartnerAccount_status_createdAt_idx" ON "PartnerAccount"("status","createdAt"); CREATE INDEX "PartnerAttribution_partnerId_status_createdAt_idx" ON "PartnerAttribution"("partnerId","status","createdAt");
INSERT INTO "MarketplacePublisher" ("id","displayName","slug","description","status","isOfficial","updatedAt") VALUES ('wazap_official_publisher','Wazap','wazap','First-party, reviewed business-conversation packs from Wazap.','approved',true,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO "MarketplaceListing" ("id","publisherId","slug","name","summary","description","category","packageType","status","requestedScopes","manifest","publishedAt","updatedAt") VALUES
('wazap_sales_pack','wazap_official_publisher','sales-qualification-agent','Sales Qualification Agent','Qualify inbound leads and prepare a structured human handoff.','A draft-only sales assistant that asks concise qualification questions, records the customer need, and escalates pricing or commitment decisions to a human.','sales','agent','published',ARRAY['inbox:read','leads:read'],'{"name":"Sales Qualification Agent","roleType":"sales_rep","tone":"professional","instructions":"Greet the customer, understand their need, timeline and budget range, answer only from approved workspace knowledge, and prepare a concise handoff. Never promise pricing, availability or contract terms. Escalate sensitive data, payments and legal commitments."}'::jsonb,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP),
('wazap_support_pack','wazap_official_publisher','support-triage-agent','Customer Support Triage','Classify support requests and prepare safe draft responses.','A draft-only support triage assistant that identifies urgency, summarizes the issue, uses approved knowledge, and routes exceptions to a human.','support','agent','published',ARRAY['inbox:read'],'{"name":"Customer Support Triage","roleType":"support_agent","tone":"empathetic","instructions":"Classify the support request, identify urgency, summarize the facts, and draft a response using only approved knowledge. Do not claim a fix occurred. Escalate security, billing disputes, legal threats, refunds and sensitive personal data."}'::jsonb,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP),
('wazap_realestate_pack','wazap_official_publisher','real-estate-follow-up-agent','Real Estate Lead Follow-Up','Prepare compliant property lead follow-ups and handoffs.','A draft-only real-estate assistant for understanding location, property type, budget, timeline and financing needs before human follow-up.','real-estate','agent','published',ARRAY['inbox:read','leads:read'],'{"name":"Real Estate Lead Follow-Up","roleType":"real_estate_agent","tone":"professional","instructions":"Understand preferred location, property type, budget range, purchase timeline and financing needs. Use only approved property knowledge. Never guarantee returns, availability, approvals or legal outcomes. Escalate offers, payments, contracts and sensitive documents."}'::jsonb,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO "MarketplaceVersion" ("id","listingId","version","manifest","changelog","status") SELECT 'ver_' || "id", "id", '1.0.0', "manifest", 'Initial reviewed first-party release.', 'published' FROM "MarketplaceListing" WHERE "publisherId"='wazap_official_publisher';
